{"seq":4,"slug":"smart-pointers","title":"智能指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/smart-pointers","wordCount":921,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能指针\">智能指针</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>智能指针是实现了 <code>Deref</code> 与 <code>Drop</code> 的结构体，因此既能像引用一样被解引用，又能携带额外语义（引用计数、内部可变性、所有权共享）。理解本篇的关键，是把它们看成对两条所有权规则的<strong>受控放宽</strong>：<code>Rc</code>/<code>Arc</code> 放宽&quot;唯一所有者&quot;，<code>RefCell</code>/<code>Mutex</code> 放宽&quot;共享即只读&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>Box&lt;T&gt;</code> 改变的是位置</strong>：把值从栈搬到堆，用于递归类型、Trait 对象与大数据转移。</li>\n<li><strong><code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code>/<code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code> 改变的是所有者数量</strong>：以运行时引用计数实现多所有者，区别仅在于原子性，即能否跨线程。</li>\n<li><strong><code>RefCell&lt;T&gt;</code> 改变的是检查时机</strong>：把借用检查从编译期推迟到运行时，换来共享引用下的内部可变性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"智能指针概览\">智能指针概览</h2><p>智能指针是实现了 <code>Deref</code> 和 <code>Drop</code> trait 的结构体，它们不仅像引用一样指向数据，还拥有额外的元数据和能力。Rust 标准库提供了多种智能指针，适用于不同的内存管理场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>智能指针</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>分配位置</th>\n<th>引用计数</th>\n<th>线程安全</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Box&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>堆上分配单个值</td>\n<td>堆</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>取决于 T</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>单线程引用计数共享</td>\n<td>堆</td>\n<td>运行时（非原子）</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>多线程引用计数共享</td>\n<td>堆</td>\n<td>运行时（原子）</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RefCell&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>运行时借用检查（内部可变性）</td>\n<td>栈/堆</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Cow&lt;&#39;a, T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>写时克隆</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>取决于 T</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"box-t-堆分配\">Box&lt;T&gt;：堆分配</h2><p><code>Box&lt;T&gt;</code> 将数据分配在堆上，栈上只保留一个指针。最常见的用途是创建递归类型和大数据堆上存储。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"enum List {&#10;    Cons(i32, Box&lt;List&gt;),&#10;    Nil,&#10;}&#10;&#10;use List::{Cons, Nil};&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let list = Cons(1, Box::new(Cons(2, Box::new(Cons(3, Box::new(Nil))))));&#10;    print_list(&amp;list);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn print_list(list: &amp;List) {&#10;    match list {&#10;        Cons(val, next) =&gt; {&#10;            print!(&quot;{} -&gt; &quot;, val);&#10;            print_list(next);&#10;        }&#10;        Nil =&gt; println!(&quot;Nil&quot;),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum List {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Cons(i32, Box&#x3C;List>),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Nil,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use List::{Cons, Nil};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let list = Cons(1, Box::new(Cons(2, Box::new(Cons(3, Box::new(Nil))))));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_list(&#x26;list);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_list(list: &#x26;List) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match list {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Cons(val, next) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            print!(\"{} -> \", val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            print_list(next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Nil => println!(\"Nil\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Box</code> 的典型场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归类型</td>\n<td>枚举/结构体自引用需要间接引用打破无限大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trait 对象</td>\n<td><code>Box&lt;dyn Trait&gt;</code> 实现动态分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大数据转移</td>\n<td>避免栈上大量数据的复制开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rc-t-引用计数\">Rc&lt;T&gt;：引用计数</h2><p><code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code> 允许数据拥有多个所有者，通过引用计数管理生命周期。当最后一个 <code>Rc</code> 被销毁时，数据被释放。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::rc::Rc;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let data = Rc::new(vec![1, 2, 3]);&#10;&#10;    let a = Rc::clone(&amp;data); // 引用计数 +1&#10;    let b = Rc::clone(&amp;data); // 引用计数 +1&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;引用计数: {}&quot;, Rc::strong_count(&amp;data)); // 3&#10;    println!(&quot;数据: {:?}&quot;, b);&#10;&#10;    drop(a); // 引用计数 -1&#10;    println!(&quot;drop a 后引用计数: {}&quot;, Rc::strong_count(&amp;data)); // 2&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::rc::Rc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = Rc::new(vec![1, 2, 3]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let a = Rc::clone(&#x26;data); // 引用计数 +1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let b = Rc::clone(&#x26;data); // 引用计数 +1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"引用计数: {}\", Rc::strong_count(&#x26;data)); // 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"数据: {:?}\", b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    drop(a); // 引用计数 -1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"drop a 后引用计数: {}\", Rc::strong_count(&#x26;data)); // 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：<code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code> 只允许共享引用（不可变访问），且不能跨线程使用（未实现 <code>Send</code>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"arc-t-原子引用计数\">Arc&lt;T&gt;：原子引用计数</h2><p><code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code> 是 <code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code> 的线程安全版本，使用原子操作维护引用计数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::Arc;&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let data = Arc::new(vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5]);&#10;&#10;    let handles: Vec&lt;_&gt; = (0..3).map(|i| {&#10;        let data = Arc::clone(&amp;data);&#10;        thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            let sum: i32 = data.iter().sum();&#10;            println!(&quot;线程 {} 计算和: {}&quot;, i, sum);&#10;        })&#10;    }).collect();&#10;&#10;    for handle in handles {&#10;        handle.join().unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::Arc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = Arc::new(vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handles: Vec&#x3C;_> = (0..3).map(|i| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let data = Arc::clone(&#x26;data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let sum: i32 = data.iter().sum();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"线程 {} 计算和: {}\", i, sum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }).collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for handle in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handle.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Arc (引用计数=3)&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;堆上的 Vec 数据&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;Arc clone 1&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;    C[&quot;Arc clone 2&quot;] --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[\"Arc (引用计数=3)\"] --&gt; D[\"堆上的 Vec 数据\"]\n    B[\"Arc clone 1\"] --&gt; D\n    C[\"Arc clone 2\"] --&gt; D</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"refcell-t-内部可变性\">RefCell&lt;T&gt;：内部可变性</h2><p><code>RefCell&lt;T&gt;</code> 将借用检查从编译期推迟到运行时，允许通过共享引用修改内部数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::cell::RefCell;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let data = RefCell::new(vec![1, 2, 3]);&#10;&#10;    data.borrow_mut().push(4);&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;数据: {:?}&quot;, data.borrow()); // [1, 2, 3, 4]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::cell::RefCell;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = RefCell::new(vec![1, 2, 3]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.borrow_mut().push(4);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"数据: {:?}\", data.borrow()); // [1, 2, 3, 4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>RefCell</code> 的借用规则在运行时检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>返回类型</th>\n<th>违规行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>borrow()</code></td>\n<td><code>Ref&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>已有可变借用时 panic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>borrow_mut()</code></td>\n<td><code>RefMut&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>已有任何借用时 panic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>try_borrow()</code></td>\n<td><code>Result&lt;Ref&lt;T&gt;, BorrowError&gt;</code></td>\n<td>返回 Err 而非 panic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>try_borrow_mut()</code></td>\n<td><code>Result&lt;RefMut&lt;T&gt;, BorrowMutError&gt;</code></td>\n<td>返回 Err 而非 panic</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合模式-rc-refcell-t\">组合模式：Rc&lt;RefCell&lt;T&gt;&gt;</h2><p><code>Rc</code> 提供多所有权，<code>RefCell</code> 提供内部可变性，两者组合实现&quot;多个所有者可修改同一数据&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::cell::RefCell;&#10;use std::rc::Rc;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Debug)]&#10;struct Node {&#10;    value: i32,&#10;    children: Vec&lt;Rc&lt;RefCell&lt;Node&gt;&gt;&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let leaf = Rc::new(RefCell::new(Node {&#10;        value: 3,&#10;        children: vec![],&#10;    }));&#10;&#10;    let branch = Rc::new(RefCell::new(Node {&#10;        value: 5,&#10;        children: vec![Rc::clone(&amp;leaf)],&#10;    }));&#10;&#10;    leaf.borrow_mut().value = 10;&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;branch: {:?}&quot;, branch.borrow());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::cell::RefCell;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::rc::Rc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Debug)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: i32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    children: Vec&#x3C;Rc&#x3C;RefCell&#x3C;Node>>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let leaf = Rc::new(RefCell::new(Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        value: 3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        children: vec![],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let branch = Rc::new(RefCell::new(Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        value: 5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        children: vec![Rc::clone(&#x26;leaf)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    leaf.borrow_mut().value = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"branch: {:?}\", branch.borrow());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cow-t-写时克隆\">Cow&lt;T&gt;：写时克隆</h2><p><code>Cow</code>（Clone on Write）在只读时避免克隆，仅在需要修改时才创建独立副本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::borrow::Cow;&#10;&#10;fn ensure_uppercase(input: &amp;str) -&gt; Cow&lt;str&gt; {&#10;    if input.chars().all(|c| c.is_uppercase() || !c.is_alphabetic()) {&#10;        Cow::Borrowed(input)&#10;    } else {&#10;        Cow::Owned(input.to_uppercase())&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let s1 = ensure_uppercase(&quot;HELLO&quot;);     // 不克隆&#10;    let s2 = ensure_uppercase(&quot;hello&quot;);     // 执行克隆&#10;    println!(&quot;{}, {}&quot;, s1, s2);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::borrow::Cow;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn ensure_uppercase(input: &#x26;str) -> Cow&#x3C;str> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if input.chars().all(|c| c.is_uppercase() || !c.is_alphabetic()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Cow::Borrowed(input)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Cow::Owned(input.to_uppercase())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s1 = ensure_uppercase(\"HELLO\");     // 不克隆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s2 = ensure_uppercase(\"hello\");     // 执行克隆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}, {}\", s1, s2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"智能指针选择指南\">智能指针选择指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{需要堆分配?} --&gt;|是| B{需要多个所有者?}&#10;    A --&gt;|否| Z[&quot;直接使用栈变量&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[&quot;Box&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{需要跨线程?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[&quot;Rc&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[&quot;Arc&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G{需要内部可变性?}&#10;    F --&gt; H{需要内部可变性?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[&quot;Rc&amp;lt;RefCell&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| E&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[&quot;Arc&amp;lt;Mutex&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| F\">graph TD\n    A{需要堆分配?} --&gt;|是| B{需要多个所有者?}\n    A --&gt;|否| Z[\"直接使用栈变量\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| C[\"Box&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;\"]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{需要跨线程?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[\"Rc&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;\"]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[\"Arc&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;\"]\n    E --&gt; G{需要内部可变性?}\n    F --&gt; H{需要内部可变性?}\n    G --&gt;|是| I[\"Rc&amp;lt;RefCell&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&amp;gt;\"]\n    G --&gt;|否| E\n    H --&gt;|是| J[\"Arc&amp;lt;Mutex&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&amp;gt;\"]\n    H --&gt;|否| F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归类型 / Trait 对象</td>\n<td><code>Box&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单线程多所有者（只读）</td>\n<td><code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单线程多所有者（可变）</td>\n<td><code>Rc&lt;RefCell&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多线程共享（只读）</td>\n<td><code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多线程共享（可变）</td>\n<td><code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按需克隆优化</td>\n<td><code>Cow&lt;&#39;a, T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>智能指针的共同点是实现 <code>Deref</code> + <code>Drop</code>：前者让它们用起来像引用，后者保证资源在最后一个所有者离开时释放。</li>\n<li><code>Box&lt;T&gt;</code> 解决的是<strong>位置</strong>问题，<code>Rc</code>/<code>Arc</code> 解决的是<strong>所有者数量</strong>问题，<code>RefCell</code>/<code>Mutex</code> 解决的是<strong>可变性</strong>问题，三者可组合。</li>\n<li><code>Rc</code>/<code>RefCell</code> 不能跨线程；跨线程共享可变状态的标准答案是 <code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code> 或 <code>Arc&lt;RwLock&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>。</li>\n<li><code>RefCell</code> 的借用规则在运行时检查，违规会 panic，因此优先在测试中暴露问题。</li>\n<li><code>Cow</code> 在只读路径上避免克隆，适合&quot;多数不变、少数需要改写&quot;的字符串处理场景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"智能指针","id":"智能指针"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"智能指针概览","id":"智能指针概览"},{"level":2,"text":"Box\\<T\\>：堆分配","id":"box-t-堆分配"},{"level":2,"text":"Rc\\<T\\>：引用计数","id":"rc-t-引用计数"},{"level":2,"text":"Arc\\<T\\>：原子引用计数","id":"arc-t-原子引用计数"},{"level":2,"text":"RefCell\\<T\\>：内部可变性","id":"refcell-t-内部可变性"},{"level":2,"text":"组合模式：Rc\\<RefCell\\<T\\>\\>","id":"组合模式-rc-refcell-t"},{"level":2,"text":"Cow\\<T\\>：写时克隆","id":"cow-t-写时克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"智能指针选择指南","id":"智能指针选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生命周期标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/lifetimes"},"next":{"title":"Trait 与泛型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/traits-and-generics"}}